msgstr "Campeões"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:304
msgid "Bought recently, often, and spend the most. Reward them."
msgstr "Compraram recentemente, com frequência e gastam mais. Recompense-os."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:308
msgid "Loyal Customers"
msgstr "Clientes Fiéis"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:309
msgid "Spend often and well. Upsell higher-value products."
msgstr "Gastam com frequência e bem. Faça upsell de produtos de maior valor."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:313
msgid "Potential Loyalist"
msgstr "Fiéis em Potencial"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:314
msgid "Recent buyers with moderate frequency. Nurture them."
msgstr "Compradores recentes com frequência moderada. Cultive-os."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:318
msgid "New Customers"
msgstr "Novos Clientes"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:319
msgid "Bought recently for the first time. Onboard them."
msgstr "Compraram recentemente pela primeira vez. Faça o onboarding deles."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:323
msgid "Can't Lose Them"
msgstr "Não Podemos Perdê-los"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:324
msgid "High-value customers who haven't bought in a while. Win them back."
msgstr "Clientes de alto valor que não compram há algum tempo. Reconquiste-os."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:328
msgid "At Risk"
msgstr "Em Risco"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:329
msgid "Used to buy frequently but lapsed. Re-engage now."
msgstr "Costumavam comprar com frequência mas pararam. Reengaje agora."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:333
msgid "About to Sleep"
msgstr "Prestes a Hibernar"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:334
msgid "Below-average recency, frequency, and value. Recover them."
msgstr "Recência, frequência e valor abaixo da média. Recupere-os."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:338
msgid "Need Attention"
msgstr "Precisam de Atenção"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:339
msgid ""
"Buy frequently but with a small basket. Raise basket size via cross-sell, "
"bundles, or higher-tier upgrades."
msgstr ""
"Compram com frequência mas com cesta pequena. Aumente o tamanho da cesta via "
"cross-sell, bundles ou upgrades de nível superior."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:343
msgid "Hibernating"
msgstr "Hibernando"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:344
msgid "Low engagement across the board. Test cheap re-activation."
msgstr "Baixo engajamento em geral. Teste reativação barata."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:348
msgid "Lost"
msgstr "Perdidos"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:349
msgid "Lowest scores everywhere. Likely gone for good."
msgstr "Pontuações mais baixas em tudo. Provavelmente foram para sempre."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:510
msgid "Recompute Customer Metrics (LTV + RFM)"
msgstr "Recalcular Métricas de Clientes (LTV + RFM)"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:511
msgid "Aggregates per-customer LTV totals from order history."
msgstr "Agrega totais de LTV por cliente a partir do histórico de pedidos."

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:521
msgid "Recompute Cohort Retention"
msgstr "Recalcular Retenção de Coortes"

#: includes/cron/customer-analytics-jobs.php:522
msgid "Builds the monthly cohort × period retention matrix."
msgstr "Constrói a matriz de retenção mensal coorte × período."

